From: kloploid <10303425+kloploid@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:14:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] thor2: the notification shade opens the Nine shade screen

With ro.config.thor2_shade naming an activity, expandNotificationsPanel,
togglePanel (long press Home, the notification key) and
expandSettingsPanel start that screen - notifications and quick settings
for the keypad - instead of SystemUI's panel, which a phone without a
touchscreen can't use. togglePanel asks the screen to close when it's
open. While locked nothing opens: the lock screen app shows the
notifications.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I1301c02a5a76ffa1b452928941d84b28c541bfbb
---
